oP ilAZBT pf-918_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-kCMLfs khbiTF pf-920_">Yes, getting started with ThePhotoStick Omni is incredibly easy! Please note, however, that it will take some time for ThePhotoStick Omni to find each of your photos and safely back them up. This time can vary depending on how many photos you have, the size of your files, and the type of device you are using. But the great thing about ThePhotoStick Omni is that anyone can use it, no matter how comfortable they are with technology!<br><br>Check out our <b><a href="https://www.manula.com/manuals/product-support/thephotostick-omni-official-user-guide/" target="_blank">User Guide</a></b> for more information on getting started with ThePhotoStick® Omni. We also offer 24/7 support if you have any questions or difficulties: support@thephotostick.com</span></p></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-gsFSjX jrgsRq pf-921_"><button type="button" class="sc-fqkwJk fCNPsG pf-922_ pf-bg-lazy pf-anchor" data-header-id="aedaa779-ea77-4b20-8bdb-c64765d92ec5" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>Which devices are compatible with ThePhotostick Omni?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="aedaa779-ea77-4b20-8bdb-c64765d92ec5" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-dcJtft hDKXay pf-924_"><p class="sc-empmoP ilAZBT pf-925_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-kCMLfs khbiTF pf-927_">Almost all major Android, iPhone, and iPad devices!<br><br>It's compatible with Windows, Android, and Mac Operating Systems:<br>- Windows: Windows 7 SP1 and later<br>- Apple: iOS and iPadOS 13.0 and later<br>- Android: 6.0 and later*<i><br></i><sup>*ThePhotoStick Omni is NOT compatible with Google Pixel smartphones.<br></sup><br>For more up to date information regarding ThePhotoStick compatibility, we recommend viewing our <a href="/pages/support-system-requirements" target="_self">System Requirements</a> page.&nbsp;</span></p></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-gsFSjX jrgsRq pf-928_"><button type="button" class="sc-fqkwJk fCNPsG pf-929_ pf-bg-lazy pf-anchor" data-header-id="3b3657f8-6256-4ca5-a864-a5e079f66430" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>How many photos can I store on ThePhotoStick Omni?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="3b3657f8-6256-4ca5-a864-a5e079f66430" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-dcJtft hDKXay pf-931_"><p class="sc-empmoP ilAZBT pf-932_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-kCMLfs khbiTF pf-934_">Approximate Number of Photos Stored on ThePhotoStick USB:<br><br>32 GB - 12,800 photos<br>64 GB - 25,600 photos<br>128 GB - 51,200 photos<br>256 GB - 102,400 photos<br>512 GB - 204,800 photos<br><br>*Please note that storage capacity per GB listed above is approximate, and exact storage amounts vary depending on file type and size.</span></p></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-gsFSjX jrgsRq pf-935_"><button type="button" class="sc-fqkwJk fCNPsG pf-936_ pf-bg-lazy pf-anchor" data-header-id="2a25aeb8-b7e4-47db-8758-4cf21d8f4278" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>What photo and video files types can ThePhotoStick Omni find and save?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="2a25aeb8-b7e4-47db-8758-4cf21d8f4278" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-dcJtft hDKXay pf-938_"><p class="sc-empmoP ilAZBT pf-939_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-kCMLfs khbiTF pf-941_">Nearly all of them! It saves your standard JPEG, HEIC, PNG, GIF, MOV, and MPEG4, but it also saves a vast array of file types as listed below:<br><br><b>PHOTO EXTENSIONS:<br></b>- JPEG (*.jpg;*.jpeg;*.jpe;*.jfif)<br>- HEIC (*.heic, *.heics, *.heif, *.heifs, *.avci, *.avcs)<br>- GIF (*.gif)
- PNG (*.png)<br>- BMP (*.bmp;*.rle;*.dib)<br>- TIFF (*.tif,*.tiff)<br>- ICO (*.ico)<br>- Camera Raw (*.crw, *.nef, *.raf, *.orf, *.mrw, *.dcr, *.mos, *.raw, *.pef, *.srf, *.dng, *.x3f, *.cr2, *.erf, *.sr2, *.kdc, *.mfw, *.mef, *.arw, *.nrw, *.rw2, *.rwl, *.iiq, *.3fr, *.srw)<br>- Photoshop (*.psd, *.pdd, *.pdp, *.pse, *.eps)<br>- PICT File (*.PCT, *.PICT)<br><br><b>VIDEO EXTENSIONS:</b><br>- MOV (*.mov, *.qt, *.hevc)<br>- MPEG4 (*.mp4, *.mpeg4, *.m4v, *.h264)<br>- AVI (*.avi)<br>- WMV (*.wmv)<br>
</span></p></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-gsFSjX jrgsRq pf-942_"><button type="button" class="sc-fqkwJk fCNPsG pf-943_ pf-bg-lazy pf-anchor" data-header-id="a0965785-53bd-4bc9-aa2b-11df61614334" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>Can I use ThePhotoStick Omni as an ongoing backup solution?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="a0965785-53bd-4bc9-aa2b-11df61614334" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-dcJtft hDKXay pf-945_"><p class="sc-empmoP ilAZBT pf-946_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-kCMLfs khbiTF pf-948_">Yes, it’s a great backup solution! Many people plug ThePhotoStick® Omni in each night for a quick and easy backup to make sure they are continually protecting their memories.</span></p></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-gsFSjX jrgsRq pf-949_"><button type="button" class="sc-fqkwJk fCNPsG pf-950_ pf-bg-lazy pf-anchor" data-header-id="4193086b-40ad-4b13-b594-918ef19bb6ae" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>How does the 30 Day Money Back Guarantee work?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="4193086b-40ad-4b13-b594-918ef19bb6ae" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-dcJtft hDKXay pf-952_"><p class="sc-empmoP ilAZBT pf-953_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-kCMLfs khbiTF pf-955_">We offer a no-hassle, 30-Day Money Back Guarantee. If you’re not 100% satisfied with your purchase from ThePhotoStick®, we are happy to help you with a return. We want you to be happy!<br><br>If you are not completely satisfied with your order, please contact us at returns@thephotostick.com and we'd be happy to facilitate your return and refund.</span></p></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-gsFSjX jrgsRq pf-956_"><button type="button" class="sc-fqkwJk fCNPsG pf-957_ pf-bg-lazy pf-anchor" data-header-id="46dddc92-bdc6-438a-89ea-2cb1a2a4fba6" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>Will I have to pay any additional customs, duties or VAT fees when I receive my order?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="46dddc92-bdc6-438a-89ea-2cb1a2a4fba6" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-dcJtft hDKXay pf-959_"><p class="sc-empmoP ilAZBT pf-960_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-kCMLfs khbiTF pf-962_">Depending on your country, it is possible that you will be charged one or more of these fees when you receive your order. </span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-ed02" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-kRRxPL efmMUe pf-963_ pf-color-scheme-1 pf-bg-lazy"><div style="--cw:1300px" class="sc-gvZzpm eFakNN"><div class="sc-jXbVAB kNtuek pf-964_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-dExXmK fNpoDq pf-965_"><div class="sc-jXbVAB kNtuek pf-966_ pf-r pf-c-cm pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row" id="about"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:6;--c-lg:6"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-dExXmK fNpoDq pf-967_"><div data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-ibQzxG kXGlkz pf-968_ pf-image-1"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/LP_Sections_5_1200x.png?v=1722963599" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/LP_Sections_5.png?v=1722963599 1536w" width="1500" height="1182" sizes="(min-width: 1536px) 1536px, (min-width: 1024px) 1280px, (min-width: 640px) 768px, calc(100vw/3)" loading="lazy" alt="LP Sections (5).png__PID:985eb61e-a1de-4d39-bc89-8bb532c31da6"/></div></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-